---
title: Service Health & Diagnostics
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as HTTP Client
    participant API as Recognition API
    participant Session as AsyncSession
    participant Pool as Connection Pool
    participant Obs as ObservabilityRepository
    participant Store as DecisionStore (fallback)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Client,DB: Legend: ENTRY = external entrypoint, Dashed arrow = optional wiring
    Note over Client,DB: Mini-map: ENTRY: GET /health -> subsystem health checks, ENTRY: GET /recognition/diagnostics/decisions -> ObservabilityRepository, Code: apps/prototype-description-service/api/main.py | recognition/interface_adapters/http/routers/diagnostics.py

    Client->>API: ENTRY: GET /health
    API-->>Client: subsystem reports (recognition + roster + scene)

    Client->>API: ENTRY: GET /recognition/health
    API->>Session: get_optional_session()
    API-->>Client: {status, database, timestamp}

    Client->>API: ENTRY: GET /recognition/health/pool
    API->>Pool: get_pool_stats()
    API-->>Client: pool metrics

    Client->>API: ENTRY: GET /recognition/diagnostics/decisions
    alt DB-backed observability available
        API->>Obs: list_decisions(filters)
        Obs->>DB: SELECT assignment_decisions
        API-->>Client: decision logs
    else fallback
        API->>Store: list(filters)
        API-->>Client: in-memory decision logs
    end
